cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you refer to this analysis, please cite it as below."
title: "Mitophagy in alcohol-related liver disease: a reanalysis of four public human liver transcriptome cohorts"
abstract: >-
  Independent reanalysis of GSE28619, GSE103580, GSE143318 and GSE270042 testing whether
  mitophagy gene expression is specifically altered in alcohol-related liver disease.
  Pathway-level enrichment is shown to track hepatocyte and mitochondrial content rather
  than pathway-specific regulation; gene-level signals, notably BNIP3, survive the
  confounding.
type: dataset
authors:
